    "note": "2026-08-21発表。改修した高炉の稼働は2030年見込み。2,300人の雇用を維持",
    "u": "https://www.ideastream.org/2026-08-21/cleveland-cliffs-announces-1b-project-in-middletown-dropping-original-hydrogen-based-plan"
